<title>THAILAND: Thai Engine '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Thai Engine '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for Thai Engine Manufacturing for 1996 ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		11.78			7.62</p>
<p>    Net			229.89		    106.81</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Thai Engine Manufacturing Plc, a diesel engine manufacturing firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
